n data-ccp-charstyle=\"x_outlook-search-highlight\">acquired</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"x_outlook-search-highlight\">by</span> <span data-ccp-charstyle=\"x_outlook-search-highlight\">WPP</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"x_xxxnormaltextrun\">.</span></span><em><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"x_xxxeop\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;79618c90-d290-5a5d-bb89-233c9f483319|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777842,&quot;&quot;,469777843,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777844,&quot;Aptos&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Aptos&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;x_xxxeop&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;xxxxeop&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}\"> </span></span></em>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"eop\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\">The Role:</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"eop\"> </span></span>&nbsp;<br><br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,335559740,&quot;240&quot;,201341983,&quot;0&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">As Account Director, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">you'll</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> champion \"earned first\" thinking to create impactful, culturally relevant consumer PR campaigns. </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">You'll</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> lead a team, build strong client relationships, and drive innovative strategies that generate buzz and deliver measurable results. This role is fun and energetic, offering great opportunities to learn and develop with a variety of complex but rewarding clients. You will </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">be responsible for</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> fostering a positive and collaborative work environment within the account management team, encouraging open communication and constructive feedback. You will manage relationships with third-party vendors, to ensure the agency delivers high-quality work that meets client expectations. You will also act as a liaison between the client and the agency's internal teams, providing clear communication and direction to ensure all parties are aligned on project goals and timelines. You can see opportunity </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">in</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> risk and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">you’re</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> not afraid to be brave and challenge your clients to want to achieve a better </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">result</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">for all.</span></span>&nbsp;<br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"eop\"> </span></span>&nbsp;<br><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\">Key Responsibilities:</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"eop\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Inspire &amp; Lead:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Mentor a team to develop and execute breakthrough, \"earned first\" PR &amp; Influence campaigns.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:60,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"31\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Client Partnership:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Build trusted advisor relationships with clients, understanding their business and anticipating their needs. Guide them across media and social communications.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&