    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About&nbsp;CoreView </span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> </span>&nbsp;<br></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">CoreView is the global leader in Microsoft 365 (M365) tenant resilience, serving over 23 million users worldwide. We empower the world’s leading organizations to master the complexity of Microsoft M365.&nbsp;&nbsp;Through robust security and precise governance, we help ensure that our client’s environments stay cyber-resilient and productive, no matter how complex they are.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our unified, cloud-native platform delivers powerful automation, rapid value, and end-to-end visibility across the entire M365 ecosystem. Backed by world-class support and a collaborative, innovative culture,&nbsp;CoreView&nbsp;is a place where your ideas matter, and your work truly&nbsp;impacts&nbsp;global enterprises.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where this role is based. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or immigration support for this position.</span></strong></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Job Summary</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are seeking a commercially driven, hands-on <strong>Sales Director - Europe</strong></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;to lead and scale&nbsp;CoreView’s&nbsp;enterprise sales activity across Europe. Reporting to the&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">VP Sales EMEA</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, this role will&nbsp;be responsible for&nbsp;driving revenue growth, building predictable pipeline, improving sales execution, and leading a team of Account Executives across key European markets.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a high-impact leadership role for someone who combines strong enterprise sales discipline with a builder mindset. You will be expected to coach and develop sales talent,&nbsp;inspect&nbsp;and progress strategic opportunities, improve forecasting accuracy, and ensure the team consistently executes against&nbsp;CoreView’s&nbsp;go-to-market strategy.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">CoreView&nbsp;helps enterprises secure, govern, automate, and manage complex Microsoft 365 environments. The ideal candidate will bring experience selling complex B2B SaaS, cybersecurity, cloud, governance, compliance, identity, or Microsoft ecosystem solutions into enterprise customers.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You will be a visible, hands-on sales leader who is comfortable engaging directly with senior customer stakeholders, supporting complex deal cycles, and creating the structure, urgency, and accountability&nbsp;required&nbsp;to scale revenue across Europe.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Job Responsibilities</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Lead, coach, and develop a team of enterprise sales professionals across European markets, ensuring consistent execution against quarterly and annual revenue targets.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Own European sales performance in partnership with the VP Sales EMEA, including pipeline generation, forecast accuracy, deal progression, and quota attainment.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Build and execute regional sales plans that align to&nbsp;CoreView’s&nbsp;EMEA go-to-market priorities, target account strategy, and growth&nbsp;objectives.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive a strong net-new business culture, ensuring the team consistently&nbsp;identifies, qualifies, and progresses enterprise opportunities.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide hands-on deal coaching across complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles, including discovery, business case development, executive alignment, negotiation, procurement, and close.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Actively&nbsp;participate&nbsp;in strategic customer meetings, executive briefings, partner engagements, and high-value negotiations where&nbsp;required.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Establish and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;strong sales operating cadence, including pipeline reviews, forecast calls, account planning, deal inspection, and performance management.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure disciplined use of CRM, sales&nbsp;methodology, and forecasting processes to improve visibility, predictability, and accountability.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner closely with Sales Engineering, Marketing, Channel, Customer Success,&nbsp;RevOps, and Product teams to improve territory execution and customer outcomes.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support the recruitment, onboarding, ramping, and ongoing development of high-performing sales talent across Europe.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify&nbsp;market trends, customer needs, competitive dynamics, and regional growth opportunities to inform sales strategy.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Represent&nbsp;CoreView&nbsp;externally with enterprise customers, partners, and industry contacts as a credible senior commercial leader.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Job Requirements</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:299,&quot;335559739&quot;:299}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven experience leading enterprise sales teams across Europe, must be within B2B SaaS, cybersecurity, cloud, Microsoft 365, identity, governance, compliance, infrastructure, or enterprise software. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong&nbsp;track record&nbsp;of delivering and exceeding regional sales targets in complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise environments.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrable experience managing, coaching, and developing Account Executives or enterprise sales professionals.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong personal sales credibility, with the ability to inspect deals, challenge assumptions, coach negotiation strategy, and support executive-level customer conversations.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience driving net-new logo acquisition, pipeline creation, territory planning, and structured account-based selling.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong understanding of complex enterprise sales cycles involving IT, security, procurement, finance, technical stakeholders, and C-level decision-makers.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Familiarity with structured sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, Challenger, Command of the Message, Value Selling, or similar.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong forecasting discipline and confidence using CRM and sales reporting tools to manage performance and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;risk.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ability to&nbsp;operate&nbsp;effectively in a remote-first, international environment with distributed teams and stakeholders.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Commercially sharp, data-informed, and comfortable balancing strategic planning with hands-on execution.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong communication, leadership, influencing, and stakeholder management skills.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">High levels&nbsp;of resilience, urgency, accountability, and ownership.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Willingness to travel across Europe for customer meetings, partner engagement, team collaboration, and company events.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Fluent English is&nbsp;required;&nbsp;additional&nbsp;European languages are&nbsp;advantageous.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">#LI-CW1</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><hr> <p><strong>Coreview Values</strong></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ownership Mindset</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">:</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;</span></strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Take ownership. Drive outcomes.</span></em><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">One Team</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">:</span> <em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">One team, one goal, embracing diversity&nbsp;-&nbsp;to&nbsp;achieve&nbsp;more together.</span></em><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Velocity:</span></strong> <em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Decide fast. Deliver fast. Repeat.</span></em></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Continuous Improvement</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">:</span> <em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Curiosity drives us. We challenge the status quo.</span></em></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Customer First: </span></strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Listen deeply. Solve boldly.&nbsp;</span></em>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Resilience: </span></strong><em><span data-contrast=\"none\">Steady under pressure.</span></em></p> <p><em><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">CoreView is an organisation which values the strength that diversity brings to the workplace. As an employer, we seek to promote equal opportunity through affirmative action. All qualified applicants will therefore receive consideration for employment and will not be discriminated against based on gender/sex, race/ethnicity, disability, age or any other protected group status (such as protected veteran status) or characteristic that is protected by local legislation. </span></span></em></p> <hr> <p><strong>Privacy Notice: </strong>By submitting your application, you acknowledge that CoreView will process your personal data for recruitment purposes in accordance with our <a href=\"https://www.coreview.com/data-privacy-notices-employees-candidates\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
