    schema:description "The Role We are seeking an engineer to build the platform that powers our global fleet of power plant controllers. You'll develop systems that ingest, store, and transfer monitoring data from our controllers, both in the cloud and at the edge on industrial PCs. Your work will enable performance analytics, event alerts, and intelligent diagnostics that our customers depend on. Tasks What You’ll Do: Own the architecture of our centralized asset management platform. Optimize ingestion, storage and transfer of data from our control software, in the cloud and at the edge. Improve infrastructure, reliability and operations of our IoT fleet. Build products on top of plant data including performance analysis, real-time alerts and diagnostic systems. Collaborate closely with our controls team to turn plant data into useful insights. Requirements What You Bring: Strong software engineering fundamentals, regardless of your primary programming language. Hands-on experience with data ingestion pipelines, distributed systems or IoT fleet operations. Track record of owning infrastructure and operations, not just application code. Problem solving, generalist mindset with ability to work across varying technologies. Clear, proactive communication skills. Nice to Have: Experience with TypeScript (used in our cloud) or Rust (used in our controller). Familiarity with edge deployments, containerization, or industrial environments. Benefits Why join H.E.A.T.? Future-Proof Career: Gain deep knowledge of the fast growing renewable energy sector and accelerate the global energy transition. High Autonomy: Work independently in a top-performing, diverse team with fast decisions and minimal bureaucracy. Early-Stage Equity: Receive company equity and have abundant opportunities for personal development Flexibility: Central Berlin office with hybrid remote options and flexible working hours. Growth & Pay: Competitive salary, generous personal development support, and fast career progression Ready to apply your engineering skills to a future-proof industry that truly matters? Click Apply Now and get to know us better! Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-h-e-a-t-energie-software-gmbh ;
