    schema:datePosted "2026-09-08"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Mission Brief</span></strong></p> <div>At Isar Aerospace, we're building Europe's future in space. As an Intern within the talent attraction team, you will help us attract and hire the exceptional talent behind our launch vehicles and mission success.&nbsp;</div> <div>From active sourcing and candidate engagement to interview coordination and recruiting analytics, you'll gain hands-on experience across the full hiring lifecycle while contributing directly to the growth of Europe's most ambitious aerospace company.&nbsp;</div> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW114497174 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8\">Your Role in Our Space Mission</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW114497174 BCX8\">:</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li>Hunt the best candidates by actively sourcing on various channels</li> <li>Screen applications and keep interviews on track by coordinating and scheduling with candidates and hiring managers</li> <li>Support us with conducting first interviews</li> <li>Publish Job advertisements across our career page and job boards</li> <li>Keep Greenhouse, our applicant tracking system, sharp and up to date</li> <li>Get hands-on with talent attraction projects e.g. the setup of our KPIs</li> <li>Support recruiting events to connect with future talent</li> <li>Spot what needs improvement and help fix it</li> </ul> <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"EOP CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW114497174 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559740&quot;:360}\">Qualification Checklist&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p> <ul> <li>Currently enrolled at a university, ideally studying business, psychology, HR, or a related field</li> <li>First practical exposure to recruiting or HR (internship, working student role, or project work) is a plus&nbsp;</li> <li>Strong organizational skills and attention to detail</li> <li>Comfortable working with data to support reporting and KPI tracking</li> <li>Proactive, reliable, and eager to learn in a fast-paced environment</li> <li>Ability to work onsite at least 2 days / week</li> <li>Fluent in English</li> </ul> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Bonus Skills</span></p> <ul> <li>German language skills</li> <li>Familiarity with Greenhouse or another ATS</li> <li>Experience with LinkedIn Recruiter or other sourcing tools</li> </ul> <p><strong>Benefits</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Subsidised lunch:</strong> Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day</li> <li><strong>Public transport ticket:</strong> Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket</li> <li><strong>Sport Clubs membership:</strong> Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)</li> <li><strong>Free snacks and drinks:</strong> Indulge in a variety of free snacks and beverages to keep you fuelled throughout the day</li> <li><strong>Physical and mental well-being:</strong> Access via OpenUp the online support from certified psychologists and lifestyle experts at no cost to you and your family</li> <li><strong>And Much More!</strong> Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team.&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p><strong>Who we are</strong></p> <p><strong><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\"></iframe></strong></p> <p>We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.</p> <p>Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.</p> <p>We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.</p> <p>We're making rockets in a way that hasn't been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!</p> <p>Want to find out more about us?</p> <p>Visit <a href=\"http://www.isaraerospace.com/\">www.isaraerospace.com</a></p> <p><strong>Data Protection<br></strong>We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our <a href=\"https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p> <p><strong><span lang=\"DE\">Disclaimer<br></span></strong><span lang=\"DE\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.</span></span></p> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-isaraerospace ;
